  "solution": "Áp dụng định lí Cô-sin trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>cos</mo><mover><mi>C</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>70</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>109</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>≈</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>109</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> km.<br>Vậy chiều dài của đường dây là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> km.",
